    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Burn Away the Old to Give Life to the New</p></blockquote><p>Druids of the Circle of Wildfire understand that destruction is sometimes the forerunner of creation, as when a forest fire spurs new growth. They bond with a primal spirit that harbors both destructive and creative power, letting them make controlled flames that burn away one thing but give life to another.</p><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><h3>Circle of Wildfire Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.fZxz921KsO48uCmj]{Circle of Wildfire Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7uHDa6oMUUZ8D0DA]{Summon Wildfire Spirit}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.fB4x9cDsmJ74UbK7]{Enhanced Bond}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.pxQFqB3TuQvAvYtp]{Cauterizing Flames}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.F0DpBhKboG0XYCYB]{Blazing Revival}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Circle of Wildfire Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Druid Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBurningHan]{Burning Hands}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCureWounds]{Cure Wounds}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFlamingSph]{Flaming Sphere}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScorchingR]{Scorching Ray}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPlantGrowt]{Plant Growth}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRevivify00]{Revivify}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAuraofLife]{Aura of Life}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFireShield]{Fire Shield}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFlameStrik]{Flame Strike}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassCureWo]{Mass Cure Wounds}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
